                  merged metagraph      69   {0,1/2,1} prob

SUMMARY
  One 3-element object, two coordinate systems, and the repo has been working in
  both without always naming the change of variables.  x |-> 2x-1 is the whole
  dictionary: EVEN/ODD is the multiplicative chart, POSITIVE/NEGATIVE the additive
  one, and the tie (1/2 <-> 0) is the fixed point they share.
